          "id": "PRR_kwDONtWm_c8AAAABB7NXfA",
          "databaseId": 4424161148,
          "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR reintroduces a `VmSpace::activate` API in `ostd` to make the page-table activation operation explicitly available again in the VM space abstraction.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Re-adds a `VmSpace::activate` function intended to activate the current task’s page table on the current CPU.\n- Adjusts imports in `vm_space.rs` to support the reintroduced API.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/asterinas/vostd/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
          "bodyHTML": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Pull request overview</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR reintroduces a <code class=\"notranslate\">VmSpace::activate</code> API in <code class=\"notranslate\">ostd</code> to make the page-table activation operation explicitly available again in the VM space abstraction.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Re-adds a <code class=\"notranslate\">VmSpace::activate</code> function intended to activate the current task’s page table on the current CPU.</li>\n<li>Adjusts imports in <code class=\"notranslate\">vm_space.rs</code> to support the reintroduced API.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">💡 <a href=\"/asterinas/vostd/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\">Learn how to get started</a>.</p>",
