      "body": "`VmSpace::activate` currently panics unconditionally (`unimplemented!()`), so any caller will crash at runtime. Also, taking `this: &RoArc<Self>` makes the API inconsistent with the (commented) Arc-based logic below and prevents the ergonomic `vmspace.activate()` method-call style used elsewhere in the codebase/tests.",
