      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">VmSpace::activate</code> currently panics unconditionally (<code class=\"notranslate\">unimplemented!()</code>), so any caller will crash at runtime. Also, taking <code class=\"notranslate\">this: &amp;RoArc&lt;Self&gt;</code> makes the API inconsistent with the (commented) Arc-based logic below and prevents the ergonomic <code class=\"notranslate\">vmspace.activate()</code> method-call style used elsewhere in the codebase/tests.</p>",
      "body_text": "VmSpace::activate currently panics unconditionally (unimplemented!()), so any caller will crash at runtime. Also, taking this: &RoArc<Self> makes the API inconsistent with the (commented) Arc-based logic below and prevents the ergonomic vmspace.activate() method-call style used elsewhere in the codebase/tests.",
