      },
      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">In case we can verify it later in the future I chose to use our <code class=\"notranslate\">Arc</code> (there is no reference needed so <code class=\"notranslate\">RwArc</code> should be sufficient). Also, <code class=\"notranslate\">self: RwArc&lt;Self&gt;</code> will be rejected by Rust because this is ill-formed <code class=\"notranslate\">self</code> so I changed its name to <code class=\"notranslate\">this</code></p>",
